The files in this directory (the `mac` module of symphonia-bundle-ape) are derived from the
`ape-decoder` crate, version 0.3.2:

    Repository: https://github.com/OMBS-IO/ape-decoder  (commit c7141a84dfdc548d871a62b79daf4815efb4eb7b)
    Crate:      https://crates.io/crates/ape-decoder/0.3.2
    Copyright:  (c) 2026 ombs.io
    License:    MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE in this directory)

Modifications for Symphonia: the crate was reduced to header/seek-table parsing and the
frame decoder (tag, ID3v2, MD5 verification, seeking/parallel convenience APIs and the I/O wrapper
were removed), the `crc32fast` dependency was replaced by an in-tree CRC-32, and the hot loops were
optimised (output is bit-identical).

